  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Victim** (1 review): Listener noted that this song rocked the audience [2]\n- **Brothers** (1 review): Listener identified this track as a highlight of the set [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Old Skin**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Nothing to Find**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Living Proof**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **talk & dedication**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Born in Time**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **talk & thanks**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Thinking of a Place**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2022-09-10.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 132 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Band announced thanks to Mystic Disc, the listener's regular music shop [3]\n- This was the first performance in New Haven, Connecticut [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2022-09-10.flac16**: taped by Clark Cain; source: MZR50 > ECM719 [1]. Also: Recording was equalized in Aucacity with bass cut and treble boost [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by BrooklynVegan Staff: [The War on Drugs played College Street Music Hall (pics, video, setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-war-on-drugs-played-college-street-music-hall-pics-video-setlist/) [5]\n- Fan art by BrooklynVegan Staff: [The War on Drugs played College Street Music Hall (pics, video, setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-war-on-drugs-played-college-street-music-hall-pics-video-setlist/) [6]\n- Fan art by BrooklynVegan Staff: [The War on Drugs played College Street Music Hall (pics, video, setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-war-on-drugs-played-college-street-music-hall-pics-video-setlist/) [7]\n- Poster by BrooklynVegan Staff: [The War on Drugs played College Street Music Hall (pics, video, setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-war-on-drugs-played-college-street-music-hall-pics-video-setlist/) [8]\n- Fan art by BrooklynVegan Staff: [The War on Drugs played College Street Music Hall (pics, video, setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-war-on-drugs-played-college-street-music-hall-pics-video-setlist/) [9]\n- Poster by BrooklynVegan Staff: [The War on Drugs played College Street Music Hall (pics, video, setlist)](https://www.brooklynvegan.com/the-war-on-drugs-played-college-street-music-hall-pics-video-setlist/) [10]",
